flowchart LR
    subgraph Browser[浏览器]
        Login[LoginView]
        Create[CreateTaskView\n上传与解析预览]
        Review[TaskObjectView\n规则与智能审核]
        PDF[PdfSourceViewer\n原文定位]
    end

    APIClient[src/api.ts\naxios 统一封装]
    Router[Vue Router\n鉴权守卫]
    FastAPI[FastAPI\napp/main.py]

    subgraph Backend[后端应用]
        Auth[routers/auth.py\n登录与当前用户]
        Tasks[routers/tasks.py\n任务与文件接口]
        Parse[parse_agent.py\n当前 Mock 解析]
        Rules[rule_engine\n确定性规则]
        ReviewAgent[review_agent.py\n专项审核会话]
        Security[security.py\nJWT 与角色权限]
    end

    DB[(SQLite / PostgreSQL\nusers, tasks, documents, results)]
    Files[(sample_pdfs\nuploads 运行时文件)]
    FutureRAG[[后续：OCR / RAG / 外部核验服务]]

    Login --> Router
    Create --> APIClient
    Review --> APIClient
    PDF --> APIClient
    Router --> APIClient
    APIClient --> FastAPI
    FastAPI --> Auth
    FastAPI --> Tasks
    Auth --> Security
    Tasks --> Security
    Tasks --> Parse
    Tasks --> Rules
    Tasks --> ReviewAgent
    Auth --> DB
    Tasks --> DB
    Tasks --> Files
    Parse -. 后续替换 .-> FutureRAG
    ReviewAgent -. 专项检索接入 .-> FutureRAG

